\end{enumerate}

statement:
Let $A \to B$ be a flat local homomorphism of Noetherian local rings.
Then the following are equivalent
\begin{enumerate}
\item $B$ is a complete intersection,
\item $A$ and $B/\mathfrak m_A B$ are complete intersections.
\end{enumerate}

statement_tex:
\label{lemma-avramov}
Let $A \to B$ be a flat local homomorphism of Noetherian local rings.
Then the following are equivalent
\begin{enumerate}
\item $B$ is a complete intersection,
\item $A$ and $B/\mathfrak m_A B$ are complete intersections.
\end{enumerate}

\label{lemma-curves-open-and-closed-in-spaces}
The $1$-morphism (\ref{equation-curves-over-proper-spaces})
$$
\Curvesstack \longrightarrow \Spacesstack'_{fp, flat, proper}
$$
is representable by open and closed immersions.

\label{lemma-descending-property-proper}
The property $\mathcal{P}(f) =$``$f$ is proper''
is fpqc local on the base.

statement:
