be differential graded algebras over $R$. The construction above
defines an equivalence of categories
$$
\begin{matrix}
\text{differential graded}\\
(A, B)\text{-bimodules}
\end{matrix}
\longleftrightarrow
\begin{matrix}
\text{right differential graded }\\
A^{opp} \otimes_R B\text{-modules}
\end{matrix}
$$

statement_tex:
