Let $f : \mathcal{X} \to \mathcal{Y}$ be a morphism of algebraic stacks.
\begin{enumerate}
\item If $f$ is separated, then $f$ is quasi-separated.
\item If $f$ is DM, then $f$ is quasi-DM.
